#   Day 5
#     launch + 4/04:28:05 6 03:03:17 - Begin trajectory correction burn #3 (OTC-3)
#              4/04:28:23 6 03:03:35   End OTC-3 (18 sec, delta-v 3 m/s)
#              4/07:03:32 6 05:38:44 - Orion enters lunar SOI, 62800 km from Moon
